    "question": "What SPF sunscreen do I actually need, and does a higher number meaningfully protect me more?",
    "summary": "SPF measures UVB protection, and the gains above SPF 30–50 are minimal; correct application and broad-spectrum coverage matter far more than chasing higher SPF numbers.",
